{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13220852","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13220852","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1322085201:1":{"text":"な、なんてことを！ダイモンはまだ子どもなのよ！子どもを傷つけようとしたの！？","source_cn":"你们——你们居然想要伤害戴蒙！他年纪那么小！你们——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB98A6311BD7B4E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322085202:1":{"text":"いいえ、あの子は――息子さんは、あなたが言うようなか弱い子どもではありませんでしたよ。ちゃんと自分を守れる力を持っています。","source_cn":"不，这位亡灵女士，那个孩子——你的儿子，他很强大，他有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA9FC2895C9F7C64","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322085203:1":{"text":"何を言っているの！？グレイヴボーンがみんな強いとは限らないのよ！あの子を抱きかかえるたびに感じる、弱り切った体……そんな体のどこに、そんなすごい力があるというの！？","source_cn":"你在说些什么？！你错了，不是所有的亡灵都很强大。我的儿...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x048DA817A02A3841","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322085204:1":{"text":"ああ、デューラ様……子どもを誰よりも理解しているのが親であり、理解していないのも親なのです。","source_cn":"噢，艾雅在上，世间最了解孩子的是父母，最不了解孩子的也...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE802CB0F069E8F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1322085205:1":{"text":"こちらへ……あの子の力を目にすれば、少しは分かってくださると思いますよ。","source_cn":"请随我来，我带你们看看他的力量，或许你们能更了解他。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x176C810DF9128DDC","variant_status":"","male":"","fema